   "source": [
    "# Monitoring & Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Duration**: 15 minutes  \n",
    "**Objective**: Set up automated monitoring and analyze your privacy progress\n",
    "\n",
    "## What You'll Learn\n",
    "\n",
    "- Configuring automated monitoring jobs\n",
    "- Analyzing breach data\n",
    "- Tracking removal progress\n",
    "- Interpreting dashboard metrics\n",
    "- Generating privacy reports\n",
    "- Understanding trends\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Why Monitoring Matters\n",
    "\n",
    "Privacy isn't a one-time task. Continuous monitoring helps you:\n",
    "\n",
    "✓ Detect new breaches immediately  \n",
    "✓ Verify removal effectiveness  \n",
    "✓ Catch reappearances quickly  \n",
    "✓ Track long-term progress  \n",
    "✓ Stay ahead of exposure  \n",
    "✓ Respond to new threats fast  \n",
    "\n",
    "The framework includes **9 automated monitoring jobs** that run on schedule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timedelta\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '../scripts')\n",
    "\n",
    "from monitoring_orchestrator import MonitoringOrchestrator\n",
    "from hibp_monitor import HIBPMonitor\n",
    "from broker_tracker import DataBrokerTracker\n",
    "from progress_reporter import ProgressReporter\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "# Initialize tools\n",
    "orchestrator = MonitoringOrchestrator()\n",
    "hibp_monitor = HIBPMonitor()\n",
    "tracker = DataBrokerTracker()\n",
    "reporter = ProgressReporter()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ Monitoring tools initialized\")\n",
    "print(f\"✓ {len(orchestrator.jobs)} monitoring jobs configured\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## The 9 Monitoring Jobs\n",
    "\n",
    "The framework runs these automated jobs on a schedule:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n",
    "print(\"⏰ AUTOMATED MONITORING SCHEDULE\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70)\n",
    "\n",
    "monitoring_jobs = {\n",
    "    \"Daily (3:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"HIBP Breach Check - Monitor for new password breaches\",\n",
    "        \"Search Monitoring - Check Google/Bing for your info\",\n",
    "        \"Archive Scanning - Monitor Internet Archive\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Weekly (Monday 2:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Data Broker Rescan - Check all 9 brokers for reappearance\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Weekly (Wednesday 10:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Social Media Audit - Check social platform exposure\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Weekly (Friday 2:00 PM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Removal Verification - Verify submitted removals completed\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Monthly (1st Day 6:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Credit Monitoring - Check for suspicious activity\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Monthly (15th Day 3:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Dark Web Scan - Check dark web for credentials\"\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"Monthly (20th Day 9:00 AM UTC)\": [\n",
    "        \"Comprehensive Audit - Full privacy audit and report\"\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "total_jobs = 0\n",
    "for schedule, jobs in monitoring_jobs.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n{schedule}\")\n",
    "    for job in jobs:\n",
    "        print(f\"  ✓ {job}\")\n",
    "        total_jobs += 1\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nTotal: {total_jobs} automated monitoring jobs\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*70)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## HIBP Breach Monitoring\n",
    "\n",
    "Monitor for password breaches automatically:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Configure your email for monitoring\n",
    "your_email = \"your@email.com\"  # ← EDIT with your email\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔐 HIBP BREACH MONITORING\\n\")\n",
    "print(f\"Monitoring email: {your_email}\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"What's checked:\")\n",
    "print(\"✓ Password breaches (known compromises)\")\n",
    "print(\"✓ New breaches (checked daily)\")\n",
    "print(\"✓ Breach severity (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"If breach detected:\")\n",
    "print(\"1. Get immediate notification\")\n",
    "print(\"2. Change password immediately\")\n",
    "print(\"3. Enable two-factor authentication\")\n",
    "print(\"4. Monitor that account\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"Severity Scale:\")\n",
    "print(\"🔴 CRITICAL: Change password NOW (credentials compromised)\")\n",
    "print(\"🟠 HIGH: Change password today (significant risk)\")\n",
    "print(\"🟡 MEDIUM: Change password this week (moderate risk)\")\n",
    "print(\"🟢 GREEN: Low risk (monitor)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Simulate a breach check\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n",
    "print(\"BREACH CHECK RESULT (Example)\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "\n",
    "breach_result = {\n",
    "    \"email\": your_email,\n",
    "    \"breaches_found\": 2,\n",
    "    \"password_compromised\": True,\n",
    "    \"risk_score\": 75,\n",
    "    \"risk_level\": \"HIGH\",\n",
    "    \"breaches\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"name\": \"LinkedIn\",\n",
    "            \"date\": \"2021-06-22\",\n",
    "            \"items_exposed\": \"Email addresses, passwords, user profiles\",\n",
    "            \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"name\": \"MyFitnessPal\",\n",
    "            \"date\": \"2018-03-12\",\n",
    "            \"items_exposed\": \"Email addresses, usernames, passwords\",\n",
    "            \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"checked_at\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n",
    "    \"next_check\": (datetime.now() + timedelta(days=1)).isoformat()\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📧 Email: {breach_result['email']}\")\n",
    "print(f\"🔴 Risk Level: {breach_result['risk_level']} ({breach_result['risk_score']}/100)\")\n",
    "print(f\"💥 Breaches Found: {breach_result['breaches_found']}\")\n",
    "print(f\"🔑 Password Compromised: {'YES - CHANGE NOW' if breach_result['password_compromised'] else 'NO'}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nBreaches Involving Your Account:\")\n",
    "for breach in breach_result['breaches']:\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n  - {breach['name']} ({breach['date']})\")\n",
    "    print(f\"    Impact: {breach['impact']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"    Exposed: {breach['items_exposed']}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n⏰ Next check: {breach_result['next_check']}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Save example\n",
    "breach_file = Path('../logs/hibp_breaches_example.json')\n",
    "breach_file.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "with open(breach_file, 'w') as f:\n",
    "    json.dump(breach_result, f, indent=2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n✓ Results saved to logs/hibp_breaches_example.json\")"
   ]
  },
